"Follow Home Assistant instructions to configure and use the newly added "
"devices and entities."
msgstr ""
"Befolgen Sie die Anweisungen von Home Assistant, um die neu hinzugefügten "
"Geräte und Einheiten zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden."

#: plugins/mqtt_home_assistant/templates/mqtt_home_assistant_help.html:57
msgid ""
"Multiple OSPy systems connected to the same MQTT broker or Home Assistant "
